                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "T.I. furnishes a competitive return on an investment for segregated scrap materials. As a manufacturing producer and distributor of specialty metals, we are uniquely both a producer and consumer of scrap materials and can offer competitive prices for segregated scrap materials. Closed loop recycling of alloy, grade and type segregated (drops, turnings, chips. swarf, etc.) enable you to reclaim the maximum value possible from your original metal purchase. Please contact you local T.I. representative to discuss scrap reclamation opportunities."
